## ⚠️ Common Mistakes

> **Full Reference:** [Common Mistakes Guide](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/neondatabase-labs/ai-rules/main/references/neon-auth-common-mistakes.md)

### Quick Summary

| # | Mistake | Solution |
|---|---------|----------|
| 1 | Wrong adapter import | Import from `auth/react/adapters` subpath |
| 2 | Forgetting to call adapter | Use `BetterAuthReactAdapter()` with `()` |
| 3 | Missing CSS import | Import from `ui/css` or `ui/tailwind` (not both) |
| 4 | Missing "use client" | Required for components using `useSession()` |
| 5 | Wrong createAuthClient signature | First arg is URL: `createAuthClient(url, { adapter })` |
| 6 | Building custom forms unnecessarily | Check if `AuthView` meets your needs first |

📖 **Code generation rules:** [Code Generation Guide](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/neondatabase-labs/ai-rules/main/references/code-generation-rules.md)

